    "description": "Once per turn, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can designate one ally within your line of sight who can hear and understand you. Until the start of your next turn, that ally becomes immune to all effects that render the ally <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a> or that deny the ally a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus to his or her <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>.",
